docs {
  8 Lagos properties + 8 listings (2 per owner). Each property file captures
  `prop_<owner>_<short>` into the env; the matching listing file references it
  and captures `list_<owner>_<short>`.

  ⚠️ NOT IDEMPOTENT — re-running creates dupes. Fire once per fresh DB.
}
